A value whose Jinja does not parse fails with the offending value on stderr, exit 2, and leaves
the file untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md "created={{ macro( }}"
-- exit --
2
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: value '{{ macro( }}': TemplateSyntaxError: unexpected '}', expected ')'
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Foo
status: draft
---

# Foo

Body paragraph.
